PETS AND COMPANIONS

pets
  Show your summons and companion.

Undead army orders (Necromancer only):
  pet follow [id]
  pet stay [id]
  pet dismiss <id|all>
  pet attack <monster>

Universal companion commands:
  conjure list
  conjure status
  conjure attack <monster>
  conjure dismiss
  conjure recall
  conjure release confirm

Raised undead and conjured companions have separate limits.
Only attack monsters you are already fighting.

See HELP CONJURE and HELP PET EXPERIENCE.
